        "title": "Rust capacity saturated at u128::MAX and was read as zero price impact",
        "severity": "critical",
        "observed": {
          "sentinel": "340282366920938463463374607431768211454",
          "sentinelMeaning": "2**128 - 2",
          "reportedPriceImpactBps": 0.0,
          "rootCause": [
            "spot_amount_out() multiplied in 256 bits; the product wrapped for amounts near u128::MAX",
            "the wrapped spot output made amount_out >= spot_out hold for every oversized input",
            "the price impact was reported as exactly 0 and the binary search accepted the saturated value"
          ],
          "poolSideVariability": "only some pools triggered it, depending on sqrtP and amount, so the baseline did not catch it"
        },
        "fix": {
          "spot": "spot_amount_out() now uses the SDK 512-bit mul_div with an upper clamp",
          "ceiling": "reserve_ceiling() computes the virtual reserve ceiling with a 512-bit mul_div",
          "guard": "spot_out > ceiling returns an error",
          "bracket": "solve_capacity() clamps the search upper bound to the ceiling"
        },
